---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactCTA from '../components/ContactCTA.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Ato Arkhurst" description="Get to know Ato Arkhurst, a front-end developer based in Arlington, Virginia.">
	<main>
		<header class="intro wrapper">
			<p class="kicker">About / A little context</p>
			<h1>I like building things<br/>I can <em>see, use,</em><br/>and improve.</h1>
		</header>
		<section class="story wrapper">
			<div class="photo"><img src="/assets/ato-portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of Ato Arkhurst" /></div>
			<div class="copy">
				<p class="lead">I’m Ato, a front-end developer based in Arlington, Virginia, just outside Washington, D.C. I currently work at SIDEARM Sports, building websites for Division I and Division II college athletic programs.</p>
				<p>What I enjoy most about front-end development is that I get to make something tangible. I can take an idea, build it, see it working, and keep making it better.</p>
				<p>A lot of my experience has been in agency-style work, moving between different clients and websites. That has taught me how to adapt, work within different systems, and pay attention to the details that make a site feel finished.</p>
				<p>Lately, I’ve been thinking beyond individual site builds—more about product decisions, reusable systems, and tools that become part of how people work or go about their day. That’s the direction I’m continuing to grow toward.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="details wrapper">
			<div><p class="kicker">Capabilities</p><ul><li>Front-end development</li><li>Responsive web design</li><li>Design implementation</li><li>Accessibility-minded UI</li><li>CMS-driven websites</li></ul></div>
			<div><p class="kicker">Where I’m growing</p><p>I’m continuing to get closer to the product thinking behind what I build: understanding the problem, shaping the experience, and turning everyday friction into something useful.</p><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/atoarkhurst/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View my LinkedIn ↗</a></div>
		</section>
	</main>
	<ContactCTA />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
	.intro { padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,9rem) 0 clamp(4rem,8vw,7rem); }
	.kicker { color:var(--ink); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.14em; font-size:.72rem; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:2rem; }
	h1 { font-size:var(--text-4xl); } h1 em { color:var(--accent); font-weight:500; }
	.story { display:grid; gap:3rem; padding-bottom:clamp(6rem,12vw,11rem); }
	.photo { overflow:hidden; border-radius:1.5rem; background:var(--paper-deep); min-height:30rem; }
	.photo img { width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:top; }
	.copy { display:flex; flex-direction:column; justify-content:center; gap:1.5rem; font-size:1.1rem; max-width:37rem; }
	.copy .lead { color:var(--ink); font:500 clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2.25rem)/1.25 var(--font-brand); letter-spacing:-.03em; }
	.details { border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding-block:clamp(5rem,9vw,8rem); display:grid; gap:4rem; }
	.details ul { list-style:none; padding:0; margin:0; color:var(--ink); font:500 clamp(1.4rem,3vw,2.2rem)/1.5 var(--font-brand); letter-spacing:-.03em; }
	.details>div:last-child>p:not(.kicker) { max-width:34rem; font-size:1.15rem; margin-bottom:2rem; }
	.details a { color:var(--ink); font-weight:600; text-decoration:none; border-bottom:1px solid currentColor; padding-bottom:.3rem; }
	@media(min-width:50em){.story{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:clamp(4rem,8vw,9rem)}.details{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:6rem}.photo{min-height:44rem}}
</style>
